# The Queen's model. Neither value is a secret: both are compiled into the
# public bundle, so a provider key must never appear here — a hosted model is
# reached through a proxy that holds the key on the server.

# Local, free, no key: Ollama on this machine. Set the model to switch the
# panel from the Trinity backend to Ollama. Ollama also has to allow the
# browser's origin: OLLAMA_ORIGINS=http://localhost:4179
VITE_QUEEN_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
VITE_QUEEN_OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:4b

# Deployed: a proxy speaking POST /chat and GET /health, holding the provider
# key in its own environment. Leave the Ollama model empty to use this.
# VITE_QUEEN_CHAT_URL=https://<service>.up.railway.app
